# Normalize line endings.
#
# Without this file, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true materializes the
# tree as CRLF while the index stores LF, leaving ~55 files permanently reported
# as modified with zero content difference. That standing false-dirty state hides
# real uncommitted work, and `git diff` shows nothing to explain it.
#
# Text files are stored LF in the index and checked out LF on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never convert.
*.wasm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
